  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Supply Improvement - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase access to, and improve the level of service of, water supply systems in communities across New Providence and the Family Islands of Abaco, North Andros, Crooked Island, Rum Cay and Eleuthera and mainstream gender considerations in human resource management of the Water and Sewerage Corporation (WSC).  The project will include climate-resilient infrastructure works for extension and replacement of potable water mains and the development of a Gender Policy and Operational Strategy for WSC.</narrative>
  </description>
